  "prefLabel": "En 502.22 Public place",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 502.22 \"Public place\" means a place which is generally open to all persons in a community, such as churches, schools, and commercial buildings, as well as any publicly owned rights-of-way or property.\n\nSource. #13796, eff 10-25-23",
